<title>CANADA: Monarch plans twin tower condo project.</title>
<headline>Monarch plans twin tower condo project.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monarch Development Corp said on Friday it plans to develop a twin tower, 10 storey condominium project close to the Skydome on Toronto's waterfront.</p>
<p>The C$35 million project is backed by Monarch and Urbancorp, a condiminium builder.  Construction is scheduled to begin in November, 1997, Monarch said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941 8100))</p>
